    "title": "Sustainable development: Theory and some simple simulations",
    "summary": "This paper presents a three-gap model to analyze the economic, social, and environmental challenges of sustainable development in Latin American economies. It examines the trade-offs between growth rates required for external equilibrium, social inclusion, and environmental sustainability, providing policy recommendations for structural transformation.",
